ces in the level of economic development of the acquirer\u2019s and target\u2019s home countries, in the quality of their legal institutions and accounting standards, and to how stringent are restrictions on FDI flows in their countries. Government -led acquirers are more likely to pursue larger targets with greater growth opportunities and more financial constraints. ... Among those deals involving government - controlled acquirers , we do find important differences involving sovereign wealth funds (SWFs).", "source": "ideas_snippet_10o"}, "afa_2011_whistleblowingandceocompensationthequita": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2011_whyareinstitutionalloansmoreexpensivetha": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2011_yieldcurvepredictorsofforeignexchangeret": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_advisorskillandacquisitionperformancedoi": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_americanrealestateurbaneconomicassociati": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_amplificationofuncertaintyinilliquidmark": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_analystcoverageandthecrosssectionalrelat": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_anetworkbasedanalysisofoverthecountermar": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_aremutualfundssittingducks": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_aretheretoomanysafesecuritiessecuritizat": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_beyondvisibilityandtransparencywhatdisti": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_capitalreallocationexposureriskinequityr": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_effectsoflocaldirectormarketsoncorporate": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_everyfamilyhasawhitesheepbetweenvertical": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_howdoesportfoliodisclosureaffectinstitut": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_onthenonexclusivityofloancontractsanempi": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_payingforriskorshareholderripoffananalys": {"abstract": "", "source": ""}, "afa_2012_securitizati